From 02033c6fb793a10a6d09c2418a9247ee9c58008b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Eaton <weaton@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:33:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] [Rust Frontend] Move the checkpoint lifecycle out of the
 HTTP routes

The prepare and restore state machines lived in the /checkpoint route
handlers. Move them to a checkpoint module that returns what a request
did, so another transport can serve the same lifecycle without copying
the transitions. The routes keep their status codes and bodies.

Assisted-by: Claude
Signed-off-by: Will Eaton <weaton@redhat.com>
